# Input

```astro
---
const name = "active";
---
<div
  class="
    foo
    bar
  "
  style="
    color:red;
    font-size:10px;
  "
></div>

<Component
  class="
    padded
    prop
  "
  style="
    color:red;
  "
/>

<div class=`foo ${name}`></div>

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
const name = "active";
---

<div class="foo bar" style="color: red; font-size: 10px;"></div>

<Component
	class="
    padded
    prop
  "
	style="
    color:red;
  "
/>

<div class=`foo ${name}`></div>

```
